---
description: Next.js and Tailwind implementation rules
globs: ["app/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.tsx", "components/**/*.tsx", "lib/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Use:
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Server components by default
- Client components only when interactivity is needed

Code quality:
- Keep files organized
- Avoid unnecessary dependencies
- Avoid premature complexity
- No fake backend unless requested
- No placeholder lorem ipsum in final sections
- Use realistic editable content

Performance:
- Optimize images
- Avoid heavy animation libraries unless justified
- Keep the landing page fast on mobile networks
- Use next/image when possible

SEO:
- Add useful metadata
- Use a clear title and description
- Structure headings properly